        ],
        "spot": "floor",
        "text": "It fell in the storm of 1911 and nobody told it. A century on its side in the silt, and the lamp still turns, sweeping the plain for ships that will never come. The creatures gather in its beam the way ships once steered by it. It has, in its way, found a use."
